1
00:00:00,659 --> 00:00:02,959
(Bernadette:)I know they would-- they did it
to Barbara Chen last year

2
00:00:02,961 --> 00:00:04,661
(Bernadette:)when I told everyone
she was pregnant.

3
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:10,963
Wait till I Snapchat that
my friends might be working

4
00:00:10,969 --> 00:00:13,699
(Raj:)on a top secret
government project.

5
00:00:14,673 --> 00:00:15,873
(Leonard:)Are you crazy?

6
00:00:15,874 --> 00:00:17,344
(Leonard:)You can't put that on Snapchat.

7
00:00:17,342 --> 00:00:21,282
(Raj:)Fine, I'll put it on Facebook
like a caveman.

8
00:00:23,749 --> 00:00:25,179
(Penny:)You know,
maybe before our meeting

9
00:00:25,183 --> 00:00:26,553
(Howard:)we should talk to a lawyer.

10
00:00:26,551 --> 00:00:27,981
(Leonard:)That's not a bad idea.

11
00:00:27,986 --> 00:00:30,086
(Raj:)Well, you must have someone
in your family that's a lawyer.

12
00:00:30,088 --> 00:00:31,688
(Howard:)Why? Because I'm Jewish?

13
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:33,720
(Howard:)That's like me saying,
"Hey, you're Indian.

14
00:00:33,725 --> 00:00:36,765
(Howard:)Doesn't your cousin work
in a call center?"

15
00:00:37,929 --> 00:00:40,969
(Raj:)My cousin does work
in a call center.

16
00:00:41,967 --> 00:00:45,097
(Howard:)And my cousin's a lawyer.

17
00:00:46,404 --> 00:00:48,634
- We don't need Howard's cousin.
- No?

18
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:51,310
(Sheldon:)We have me.

19
00:00:51,309 --> 00:00:53,709
(Leonard:)You're not a lawyer, Sheldon,
you're just a know-it-all.

20
00:00:53,712 --> 00:00:55,182
(Sheldon:)I am not a know-it-all.

21
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:57,210
(Sheldon:)I'm a person
who knows lots of things

22
00:00:57,215 --> 00:01:00,655
(Sheldon:)and likes to correct
other people when they're wrong.

